# THE FOUR-TOWN CLUSTER RUN CONTINUED FROM 175,000 WITH ONE CHANGE: THE FAULT CHARGE 1 -> 10
# (user 2026-11-15: "ok do it", on my recommendation after the charge-50 run fell away).
# = slurm/cluster_frl_c0actor_privcritic_4towns_ar2_keepgoal_nojx_fgx_lc01_miss_2m_par.env (job 466519) with ONLY:
#   a lane crossing, a collision or leaving the road costs 10 once and ends the episode. It was 1 (crossing,
#   collision) and 1 + 1 (off-road: the crossing charge plus EXPLORE_OFF_ROAD_PENALTY, now 0 so every fault
#   costs the same 10). The goal band stays 5-25 m.
# WHY 10 AND NOT 50: slurm/cluster_..._fault50_goal50_resume_par.env (job 466554, charge 50 AND goals to 50 m,
#   resumed from the same checkpoint) lost ground in 17,000 decisions: training goal success 0.58 -> 0.38,
#   metres per fault 71 -> 46, explore distance 76 -> 47 m, the critic's value +33 -> +1, steering gap 0.25 -> 0.39.
#   The charge was paid without the faults getting rarer, so the value of driving on went to zero -- the
#   condition of the earlier collapses. 10 is ten times the old charge and about a tenth of an arrival (+100).
#   ONE change at a time: the 50 m goals are not carried over, so this run reads the charge alone.
# The junction ramp restarts at 0.85 (where job 466519 had it), not at 0.5.
# Start with FRL_RESUME=<frl_c0actor_priv_4towns_lc01_miss_2m>/step_175000 under a NEW run name.
# READ: m_per_fault and q in training (q must stay clearly positive), then the 80-episode validation.
. "$REPO/slurm/cluster_frl_c0actor_privcritic_4towns_ar2_keepgoal_nojx_fgx_lc01_miss_2m_par.env"
export LANE_DEPARTURE_PENALTY=10 LANE_COLLISION_PENALTY=10 EXPLORE_OFF_ROAD_PENALTY=0
export JUNCTION_RAMP_START=0.85
